### 11. DEPENDENCIES

**Key packages (from package.json):**
- `@kynetic-ai/shared` - Shared types (Workflow, Task, Item, etc.)
- `lucide-svelte` - Icon library (~560 icons)
- `bits-ui` - Headless component library
- `marked` - Markdown parsing
- `isomorphic-dompurify` - HTML sanitization
- `svelte` v5.45+ - Latest with runes
- `tailwindcss` v4.1+ - Latest Tailwind
- `@sveltejs/kit` v2.49+ - SvelteKit framework

