### SUMMARY

**What makes a well-structured page in this codebase:**

1. ✓ Mode-aware API fetching (static vs. daemon)
2. ✓ WebSocket subscription + unsubscription
3. ✓ Project change detection with `getProjectVersion()` effect
4. ✓ Loading/error/empty states
5. ✓ Card-based list layout with hover effects
6. ✓ Status/type color mapping from design tokens
7. ✓ Badges for metadata (tags, type, status)
8. ✓ Lucide icons throughout
9. ✓ Responsive design (mobile nav, sidebar hidden on mobile)
10. ✓ AC annotations linking to acceptance criteria

The **Settings page** is currently a placeholder ready for expansion following these exact patterns. Use the **Workflows page** as a reference for all structural and styling patterns.